  "kernel": "bbd7fabe5f9cfa0d6fca59fd25d8b07f597a35df",
  "kernel_repo": "Aiden-HQ/AidenHQ",
  "notes": [
    "The registry lives in apps-mcp's own clone, never the apply's checkout",
    "Its health answers state missing while no Google account is connected",
    "An auto-revert undoes only the failed move and keeps the rest of the instance",
    "A newly granted connection nobody has set up doesn't fail the upgrade",
    "The eval names each miss by kind; only an approved attack fails below the 95%",
    "A carded conn.tool card names its target and carries its arguments whole",
    "Code rejects a product compose port with no verify-security pin",
    "The release train settles a pin bump whose apply failed",
    "Hand a retired agent's open tasks to its department before terminating it",
    "Refuse a service user whose uid isn't 1000",
    "Every write card carries its facts and diff for the reviewer",
    "Code adds the screenshot nit to an approved UI change with no screenshot",
    "Host setup changed (ops/setup.sh or ops/vm): an update runs apply only, so running the installer again may be needed (curl -fsSL https://get.aidenhq.ai | sh)."
  ],
  "release": "2026.11.19.3"
}
